  {
    "body": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">Based in the Hirschwangerhof, a historic countryside inn one hour south of Vienna, the Commons Hub is nested in the Austrian Alps near Reichenau an der Rax, once the Habsburg Monarchy's summer retreat.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">The Hirschwangerhof accommodates 30 overnight guests and up to 100 event guests, while the extraordinary natural and cultural surroundings offer diverse outside activities and adventures.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">Conceptually, the Hub aims to be an open community space and experimental playground for radical thinkers and doers, bridging the progressive web3 ecosystem and the broader Commons movement.</p>",
