    "body": "<p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px\">Whether you need a place to stay, a venue for your event, or help planning it, we’re here to support you.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px\">Our spaces and services are designed for connection, collaboration, and creativity.</span></p>",
