    "body": "<img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/4ab5375d-4d7c-4509-991f-4f1fbdc2d4a0\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Welcome to the<strong> commons hub,</strong></span></h1><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">a communal guesthouse and events venue in the Austrian Alps, just one hour south of Vienna.</span></h3><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">The<strong> commons hub</strong> is a harbor for artists, dreamers, hackers, and tinkerers — a shared space where people and ideas meet to <strong>weave new perspectives</strong> across technology, economy, society, and nature in pursuit of sustainable futures.</span></span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Its intimate atmosphere, egalitarian principles and stunning natural surroundings foster deep and lasting connections among peers.&nbsp;Be it a conference, a retreat, or a celebration among friends — Here, ideas flourish, connections deepen, and memories are made.</span></span></h6>",
    "date_created": "2025-07-12T19:07:31.890Z",
