    "body": "<p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">From solo wanderers and digital nomads<br>to small teams, artists-in-residence, and friends passing through —</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">the <strong>commons hub</strong> offers more than just a place to sleep.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">It’s a space to slow down, plug in (or out), and feel at home.</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Not your average guesthouse.</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Multiple communities have shaped this house over the years.</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">You feel it in the details — from scrappy fixes to shared jokes that stuck around.</span><span><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Laid-back, but intentional.<br><strong>Minimal rules. Maximum freedom.</strong></span><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A place to feel at home — even if you just arrived.</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Common areas</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span>Before picking a bed or room, here's what's yours no matter what:</span></p><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Lounge</strong></span></h6><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/c34b64ac-4708-45cd-a5d3-7997299ccf2d\"><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The heart of the house — vintage couches, a weathered bar, and a record player and vinyls for late-night moods.</span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Shared Kitchen</strong></span></h6><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/207602ff-b38e-4ff1-aab4-85aaeb57dce5\"><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Once a restaurant kitchen — now the stage for late-night cooking sessions.<br>Fully stocked with utensils, spices, oils, and enough pots and pans to feed a small revolution.</span><span><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Garden</strong></span></h6><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/8b60bc3d-0411-40c7-9970-832d583aef24\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Big enough for frisbee, cozy enough for quiet moments.<br>Includes a fire bowl, herb beds, shady corners — and a FarmBot with a life of its own.</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>rooms &amp; prices</strong></span></h3><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><em>All prices include 10% VAT + city taxes (local tourist tax 3€ and climate contribution 1€).</em></span><span><br><br></span></h6><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Dormitory</strong> (4–6 people/room): €35.20 + €4 per person/night</span></p><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/80707fdc-ef14-4935-ad0d-d75acb45c6b5\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Twin Room</strong> (2 separate beds): €46.20 + €4 per person/night</span></p><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/d1253c01-4b53-4eff-a6a9-cd6511ff23b0\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Double Room</strong> (shared bed): €46.20 + €4 per person/night</span></p><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/3e1f6de9-a123-403d-8347-135b43348364\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Single Occupancy</strong>: €85 + €4 per night <br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">☞ <em>Special rates may be available for longer stays — just ask.</em></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>How to book</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">We are working on our own booking app — but for now, just <strong>send us an email</strong> to </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\" href=\"mailto:office@commons-hub.at\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">office@commons-hub.at</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> with the subject <strong>\"Booking: Accommodation\"</strong> and include:</span></p><ul><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Number of guests</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Room preference (single, double, twin, dormitory)</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Arrival and departure dates</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Our team will respond shortly with the next steps.</strong></span></p>",
